# Undo Steps and Recovery

## System Restore
1. Open Control Panel.
2. Go to Recovery.
3. Click Open System Restore.
4. Choose the restore point named PreOptimize-Aether-YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS and follow the wizard.

## Re-enable background apps
Run in an elevated PowerShell:
```powershell
Set-ItemProperty -Path "HKCU:\Software\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\BackgroundAccessApplications" -Name GlobalUserDisabled -Value 0 -Type DWord -Force
